---
title: 'TypeScript narrowing patterns I reach for every week'
description: 'Discriminated unions, assertion functions, and the satisfies operator — a working tour of the narrowing techniques that make TypeScript feel like a superpower.'
publishedAt: 2026-05-04
tags: ['TypeScript', 'Patterns']
